# Code of Conduct

## Our Standard
Be nice. This is a personal project, and we are here to have fun and learn. Kindness and respect are required at all times, no matter what happens.

## Reporting Meanies
If you see someone being mean, disrespectful, or "messing around" in the comments or issues:
1. **Do not engage.**
2. Report the behavior directly to **KA Xplorer codes**.
3. We have a zero-tolerance policy for meanies. 

We want to keep this community helpful and positive!
